{
  "slug": "itential-builder",
  "name": "Itential Builder",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Spec-Driven Development for infrastructure automation on the Itential Platform. AI agents deliver end-to-end — from requirements through feasibility, design, build, and as-built documentation. Covers workflows, templates, compliance, devices, IAG, FlowAgent, and MOP.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `builder-agent` (Use this skill when someone has an approved solution design and is ready to build), `documentation` (Use this skill to survey and catalog an Itential platform — when someone wants to know what's on…), `explore` (Use this skill whenever someone wants to connect to an Itential platform and browse, inspect, or discover what's…), `flowagent` (Create and run AI agents on the Itential Platform (Agent Project Service, Model Registry Service, Tools Service, Agent…), `flowagent-to-spec` (Convert a FlowAgent into a deterministic workflow spec), `iag` (Build and run IAG (Itential Automation Gateway) services — Python scripts, Ansible playbooks, OpenTofu plans), `itential-devices` (Manage network devices, backups, diffs, device groups, and device templates in Itential Configuration Manager), `itential-golden-config` (Build golden config trees, config specs, compliance plans, run compliance checks, grade reports, and remediate violations), and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install itential-builder@claude-community` from `itential/builder-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
